{"unit_id":"tag:06FH:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism）。须证明投影（projection）<MATH_0004>满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）。我们已知左端可表（representable）为代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>，见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>。因此，须证明相应的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的满射（surjective）、局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）且平坦（flat）的态射。我们所讨论的代数空间（algebraic spaces）态射（morphisms）的性质在 fppf 拓扑（topology）中关于靶局部，因此可在<MATH_0007>上 fppf 局部地检查。由构造，存在 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0008>，它覆盖<MATH_0009>，使得<MATH_0010>来自态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。（注意，<MATH_0012>表示<MATH_0013>-纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0014>，所以一切都与经由<MATH_0015>的基变换（base change）相容。）因此，可假设<MATH_0016>来自<MATH_0017>。此时可知<MATH_0018>。第一个等式由《范畴（Categories）》的引理<REF_0003>得到，第二个等式由《空间（Spaces）中的群胚（Groupoids）》的引理<REF_0004>得到。显然，最后一个<MATH_0019>-纤维积（fibre product）由代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0020>表示，且投影（projection）<MATH_0021>平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation），因为它是平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（finitely presented）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>的基变换（base change）。它也满射（surjective），因为<MATH_0023>有一个截面（section）（即群胚（groupoid）的恒等（identity）<MATH_0024>）。这就证明了引理。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"so