{"unit_id":"tag:06PI:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《空间（Spaces）中的群胚（Groupoids）》的第<REF_0001>节中，我们定义了商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>，它与代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0002>相伴。注意，<MATH_0003>是取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stack），其对角（diagonal）可表（representable）为代数空间（algebraic spaces）（见《自举》的引理<REF_0002>及《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0003>），且存在一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>以及一个<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，后者是一个“fppf 满射（surjection）”：其意义是它在对象（objects）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的预层（presheaves）上诱导一个映射（map），而此映射在层化（sheafification）后成为满射（surjective）。然而，<MATH_0007>一般并非代数叠（algebraic stack）。这与定理<REF_0004>不矛盾，因为<MATH_0008>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>可能并不平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n构造非代数（non-algebraic）的商叠（quotient stacks）的例子，最容易的方法是考察形如<MATH_0010>的商（quotients），其中<MATH_0011>是概形（scheme），<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>上的群概形（group scheme），它平凡地作用于<MATH_0014>。也就是说，我们将在下面（引理<REF_0005>）看到：若<MATH_0015>是代数（algebraic）的，则<MATH_0016>必须平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）。一个具体例子见《例》的第<REF_0006>节。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"non-algebraic","target_term":"非代数"},{"source_term":"quotient stacks","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"quotients","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"空间","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"叠的取值范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"此处为 fppf 满射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"完整同构类名称；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化